      "Hana Rizk is a podiatrist (ABN: 99 665 490 120) (POD0002693623) consulting at the Earlwood centre.",
      "Hana is a trusted and passionate podiatrist that graduated with a Bachelor of Podiatric Medicine from Western Sydney University, providing a comprehensive range of podiatric services including diabetic foot care, foot pain management, sports injuries, and minor surgeries. She strongly believes in empowering her patients with knowledge, helping them make informed decisions about their long-term foot health.",
      "Taking the time to listen closely to your concerns, she tailors her clinical services to meet your specific individual needs. Her approach is completely centred on empathy, ensuring you feel comfortable and valued during every visit by combining her structural expertise with a warm and caring demeanour."
